.TH SDL_HasProperty 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HasProperty \- Return whether a property exists in a group of properties.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_properties.h>
.PP
.BI "bool SDL_HasProperty(SDL_PropertiesID props, const char *name);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I props
the properties to query\[char46]
.TP
.I name
the name of the property to query\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns true if the property exists, or false if it doesn\(aqt\[char46]

.SH THREAD SAFETY
It is safe to call this function from any thread\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This function is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

